# Intentionally without a single variable (D-180).
#
# While APP_ENV is `testing`, Laravel loads this file instead of .env — its presence alone keeps a developer's .env out
# of every test run. The values a test sees are pinned in tests/env.php and applied by tests/bootstrap.php; anything
# written here would be a second place to look, and PinnedEnvironmentTest fails if a line appears.
